WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.040
Welcome to DBL Group's TalentHub!

2
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:08.060
As a board member you never sign in:
you decide from your own link in an email.

3
00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:11.960
In this video we'll see how
to approve a requisition,

4
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:17.480
how to decide a Hiring Approval Sheet,
and why the link must stay with you alone.

5
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:22.400
Let's get started!

6
00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:26.630
One, when the CHRO sends a
requisition to the board.

7
00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:33.150
Two, a Hiring Approval Sheet for a hire.
Both take a few minutes, let me show you.

8
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:37.300
Who sends them?
A requisition comes from the CHRO,

9
00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:41.437
when they feel the
decision is the board's.

10
00:00:41.557 --> 00:00:45.861
A Hiring Approval Sheet comes
from Head of Talent Acquisition,

11
00:00:45.981 --> 00:00:51.500
after interviews and salary are settled,
and only once the CHRO has approved it.

12
00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:54.770
The first email, Board approval needed.

13
00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:59.490
The link opens the requisition:
the post, how many,

14
00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:04.150
unit, department, place,
when it is needed, who raised it,

15
00:01:04.270 --> 00:01:08.954
the job analysis,
and who has approved so far.

16
00:01:09.304 --> 00:01:13.424
Below, Approve and Reject.
Reject needs a reason.

17
00:01:13.544 --> 00:01:18.504
Click Approve, a thank-you page,
done. HR is told.

18
00:01:18.854 --> 00:01:23.134
To reject, write the reason in
the remark box first, then Reject.

19
00:01:23.894 --> 00:01:29.934
The requisition is Rejected,
the raiser and the CHRO are told,

20
00:01:30.054 --> 00:01:33.494
and your reason stays in
the requisition's history.

21
00:01:33.844 --> 00:01:38.924
With several on the board,
the first answer is the decision.

22
00:01:39.044 --> 00:01:43.124
The second person opening the
link sees Already decided.

23
00:01:43.444 --> 00:01:46.884
The link lasts fourteen days,
then it shows an expiry message.

24
00:01:47.234 --> 00:01:53.194
The second email, Board Approval Request,
with a sheet number starting HAS.

25
00:01:53.714 --> 00:01:58.314
The table is in the email, and the
link opens the full sheet: candidate,

26
00:01:58.434 --> 00:02:03.074
post, unit, education, experience,
last organization, proposed salary.

27
00:02:03.424 --> 00:02:08.424
Click View CV on any candidate
and the CV opens in a new tab.

28
00:02:08.544 --> 00:02:12.064
The link says whether it is the
Personal CV or the BDJobs CV.

29
00:02:12.414 --> 00:02:18.294
Column by column: education, experience,
last organization, from the CV.

30
00:02:18.414 --> 00:02:24.014
Under each row, who approved the vacancy.

31
00:02:24.134 --> 00:02:28.214
The salary, fixed from the
committee's marks and DBL's bands.

32
00:02:29.054 --> 00:02:31.774
If you approve,
the offer goes out at this salary.

33
00:02:32.124 --> 00:02:36.324
One decision for the whole sheet,
not candidate by candidate.

34
00:02:36.684 --> 00:02:40.043
To stop something,
Return the sheet with a reason,

35
00:02:40.163 --> 00:02:46.284
which is recorded against every candidate
on it. Today I only show it, Back.

36
00:02:46.634 --> 00:02:50.434
Approve all, confirm. Sheet approved.

37
00:02:51.274 --> 00:02:55.514
The recruiter moves on to the offer
letter. This link lasts sixty days.

38
00:02:55.864 --> 00:03:01.424
After approval: the recruiter sends the
offer letter with the CHRO's signature,

39
00:03:01.544 --> 00:03:07.064
the candidate accepts on their portal,
then joining. Nothing more for you to do.

40
00:03:07.414 --> 00:03:13.534
On security. The link is yours alone,
do not forward it.

41
00:03:13.654 --> 00:03:15.534
One link, one item.

42
00:03:15.654 --> 00:03:20.614
And the email's footer says it is
automated; a reply reaches nobody.

43
00:03:20.964 --> 00:03:25.484
An old or wrong link says so on the page:
expired, or not found.

44
00:03:25.764 --> 00:03:31.084
Then ask for a new one: for a sheet,
Head of Talent Acquisition's Resend;

45
00:03:31.204 --> 00:03:34.241
for a requisition, the CHRO's office.

46
00:03:34.591 --> 00:03:38.791
Questions. The link says expired
or Already decided?

47
00:03:39.551 --> 00:03:43.911
Someone decided before you,
or the fourteen or sixty days passed.

48
00:03:44.791 --> 00:03:48.591
Want to change a decision?

49
00:03:48.711 --> 00:03:52.991
Not from the page; speak to the CHRO's
office or Head of Talent Acquisition.

50
00:03:53.341 --> 00:03:56.901
In short. A requisition: the email,

51
00:03:57.021 --> 00:04:01.255
Approve or Reject with a reason,
the first answer decides.

52
00:04:01.375 --> 00:04:07.274
A hiring sheet: View CV,
Approve all or Return the sheet.

53
00:04:07.394 --> 00:04:11.622
Questions about a sheet go to
Head of Talent Acquisition,

54
00:04:11.742 --> 00:04:16.621
about a requisition to the
CHRO's office. Thank you.

